+| `semantic.k:24-30` | `PyVal ::= intVal(Int) | boolVal(Bool) | strVal(String) | pairList(PyVal,PyVal) | builtinInt | splitMethod(PyVal) | slashSplit(String)` |
+| `semantic.k:31` | `Int ::= decimalValue(String)` |
